      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I agree! My bigger concern was for `PaintOption` where we assume we cannot skip the xform, but this should be solved w/ the parent change to add that member attribute to PaintOption.\n\nI do like this sensible structure, but this will, however, impact all primitive color additions that have `skipColorXform \u003d true`, not necessarily *just* drawShadow calls. Do you foresee this being an issue? We currently only set skipColorXform to true for precompilation specifically for drawShadows...",
