      "writtenOn": "2025-06-17T20:32:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can understand only making this simplification when we are explicitly told we can skip the color conversion.\n\nAdded upstream change to add `fSkipColorXform` to `PaintOption`, so now the precompilation key should match the PaintParamsKey.",
